OL,3,ACopilot in deadly Florida jet crash
OL,4,Aidentified in reports as 20-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 20-year-old copilot was among nine
OL,7,Fpeople killed when a small jet crashed
OL,8,Fand exploded in Florida on Sunday,
OL,9,Faccording to US media.
OL,11,FNathalia Filgueiras, who earned her
OL,12,Fpilot's licence when she was 17, is
OL,13,Freported to have been one of two crew
OL,14,Fmembers aboard the Learjet 60 from
OL,15,FAustin, Texas, to the Bahamas when it
OL,16,Fcrashed near West Palm Beach.
OL,18,FThe National Transportation Safety
OL,19,FBoard (NTSB) said it would investigate
OL,20,Fto what extent ice and turbulence may
OL,21,Fhave contributed to the crash, and
OL,22,Fwhether human error played a role.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
